    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">·8月更新内容前瞻</span></span></span></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"552cede38af123bb2149af9365cbcaff\" alt=\"08月更新前瞻.png\" title=\"08月更新前瞻.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240613/552cede38af123bb2149af9365cbcaff.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·讲述者列表</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"e675e4c6ae4e86100854dc1f5468bce3\" title=\"8月月小队.png\" alt=\"8月月小队.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20240718/e675e4c6ae4e86100854dc1f5468bce3.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>奇遇讲述者泥岩</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">她乐于助人，并不会去计数，也不会太在意帮助了谁。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·假说辑录</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"c0f2fe8e9b5a6324a0047171307df232\" alt=\"08高级自身干员技巧集.png\" title=\"08高级自身干员技巧集.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240613/c0f2fe8e9b5a6324a0047171307df232.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">假说辑录添加内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">假说辑录的等级上限提升至</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">65</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">8月稀有奖励高级资深干员技巧集</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">全面详实地记载了专家级技艺的集录，干员经过学习操练，可以快速积累经验，达到专家级的认定标准。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·本月委托栏</strong></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">本月委托栏将会覆盖一批委托。委托更新后，上月的委托进度将不会被继承。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">您将获得可在本月使用的四次刷新未完成委托的机会。点击刷新后，即可重新获得同等级的委托。</span></span></span></p>",
